{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Implement \u00a320,000 fee for ILR or British citizenship",
        "additional_details": "I propose the introduction of a \u00a320,000 fee for individuals who wish to obtain ILR or a British passport. If immigrants want a British passport, which automatically gives them the right to the UK benefit system which in my view is suffering, I\u2019m sure they will pay the \u00a320,000 fee. I don\u2019t think immigrants should automatically be eligible to become British after for example 5 years of residency, and I think getting a British passport or ILR should be a privilege.",
        "background": "As a resident of the United Kingdom, I am deeply concerned about the rising costs of social care, health and other public services. One potential solution that I propose is the introduction of a \u00a320,000 fee for individuals who wish to obtain indefinite leave to remain (ILR) or a British passport.",
